          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At the heart of our atelier lies a deep reverence for heritage, artistry, and timeless elegance. We craft jewellery that transcends ornamentation — each piece is a narrative of culture, craftsmanship, and quiet opulence.<br/>Every creation is meticulously handcrafted using the highest quality stones, moissanites, and AD embellishments, set in rich gold-plated finishes that mirror the glow of tradition and royalty. Our designs celebrate intricate detail — echoing age-old techniques, while embracing a modern woman’s spirit of individuality.<br/>Rooted in legacy and refined with innovation, our collections span regal kundan sets, moissanite solitaires, temple-inspired motifs, and vibrant polki designs. Whether adorned for a celebration or collected as an heirloom, our jewellery is made to be cherished — forever.<br/>This is not just jewellery. This is art. This is legacy. This is luxury.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
